Pax's Space~
   You find yourself in a curious position, complete weightlessness.  At first
the feeling is a little strange even out of place.  After becoming accustom to
this environment you  begin to feel refreshed now that  gravity no longer is a
burden. Below you is the most spectacular view of Raven against the background
of the  Galaxy and the universe beyond.   Many odd objects and half  finished
creations float nearby,  you turn to investigate but something tells you that
it would be better to stay put and enjoy the view.    
